りと濡れて、瞳は爛々としながらも僅かに涙で潤んでいる……\n肉食獣の本能が抑えられないまま、燃えるような獣欲に怒りや苛立ちと、こんな無理矢理じゃ拒絶されるかも……という微かな不安が混ざったような感じで……！\n\n複雑な乙女っぽさと猛獣な感じが強いと嬉しいです……！\n\n長文で申し訳ありません！また、設定はいろいろいい感じに変えていただいて構いません！\nどうかよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dangan/works/45", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c1417eec/uploads/origins/9100aabe-a73b-41c4-a875-25836ff75beb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3609442e94c6baf865dd0d0b8023875d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c1417eec/uploads/origins/9100aabe-a73b-41c4-a875-25836ff75beb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3609442e94c6baf865dd0d0b8023875d, https://si.imgix.net/c1417eec/uploads/origins/9100aabe-a73b-41c4-a875-25836ff75beb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad9cc3f5e0ff2b718b60cf8288323234 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c1417eec/uploads/origins/9100aabe-a73b-41c4-a875-25836ff75beb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eb2925acceda76d3abc9c8ce74e8df8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I was wondering if I could get a picture of my nudibranch character Umitama climbing out of a swimming pool, possibly wearing a one piece swim suit.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/5EUHx7g\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/5EUHx7g", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dangan/works/44", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/634a58a2/uploads/origins/ccf1478a-320e-4554-9d1f-2eb86b113d45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3ed2c4fbca76b64357bcd1a63ce9f9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/634a58a2/uploads/origins/ccf1478a-320e-4554-9d1f-2eb86b113d45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3ed2c4fbca76b64357bcd1a63ce9f9, https://si.imgix.net/634a58a2/uploads/origins/ccf1478a-320e-4554-9d1f-2eb86b113d45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20